{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue Humanity In the Blink Of An Eye!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/109e100a7a0ff87ffa906c25960a2cbb.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/109e100a7a0ff87ffa906c25960a2cbb.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/109e100a7a0ff87ffa906c25960a2cbb.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Cradle is a momentum-based platformer. Play as HelperBody, a robotic kangaroo with a penchant for speed. Use your speed and abilities to maintain a complex network of underground facilities. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Your Speed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/a9f47e3923bd69ad97cc2bc32d40bf65.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/a9f47e3923bd69ad97cc2bc32d40bf65.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/a9f47e3923bd69ad97cc2bc32d40bf65.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HelperBody can build ridiculous levels of speed by using momentum! Land on a slope just right to gain a large boost, then jump while zooming up a hill to launch yourself high into the air! Bounce off a spring or launcher to go even faster still! Ride back and forth on a half-pipe to build up momentum! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Off The Walls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f647dd22082232f5bb25db759792f9bf.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f647dd22082232f5bb25db759792f9bf.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f647dd22082232f5bb25db759792f9bf.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little robo roo can ride up walls, then wall jump off of them! Great for getting up those tight spaces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slingshot Whiplash!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/2cc171bb40525a4d9a4204b920f3d43c.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/2cc171bb40525a4d9a4204b920f3d43c.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/2cc171bb40525a4d9a4204b920f3d43c.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a serious condition! In case of significant damage, report to your local HollowBody unit for regeneration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed Is Sanctuary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/18343652b560c867790edced69c04359.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/18343652b560c867790edced69c04359.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/18343652b560c867790edced69c04359.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in Project Cradle, speed is the name of the game. Move at high velocity to generate a protective shield that deflects enemy attacks! Perform high flying feats by jumping while running up slopes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Certain We'll Find Someone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will find people. We just have to! They've gotta be around here somewhere... Maybe they're just hiding? No, I don't know why they'd do something silly like that. Are they just... Really small, maybe? Hmm... Whatever the case, we have to find them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have to.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2757950?t=1771981312","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2757950?t=1771981312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/7ccd90a8ae4450d7a826996e1a0ec5b0b5ef636f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771981312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/7ccd90a8ae4450d7a826996e1a0ec5b0b5ef636f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771981312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2757960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue Humanity In the Blink Of An Eye!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/109e100a7a0ff87ffa906c25960a2cbb.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/109e100a7a0ff87ffa906c25960a2cbb.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/109e100a7a0ff87ffa906c25960a2cbb.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Cradle is a momentum-based platformer. Play as HelperBody, a robotic kangaroo with a penchant for speed. Use your speed and abilities to maintain a complex network of underground facilities. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Your Speed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/a9f47e3923bd69ad97cc2bc32d40bf65.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/a9f47e3923bd69ad97cc2bc32d40bf65.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/a9f47e3923bd69ad97cc2bc32d40bf65.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HelperBody can build ridiculous levels of speed by using momentum! Land on a slope just right to gain a large boost, then jump while zooming up a hill to launch yourself high into the air! Bounce off a spring or launcher to go even faster still! Ride back and forth on a half-pipe to build up momentum! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Off The Walls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f647dd22082232f5bb25db759792f9bf.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f647dd22082232f5bb25db759792f9bf.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/f647dd22082232f5bb25db759792f9bf.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little robo roo can ride up walls, then wall jump off of them! Great for getting up those tight spaces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slingshot Whiplash!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/2cc171bb40525a4d9a4204b920f3d43c.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/2cc171bb40525a4d9a4204b920f3d43c.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/2cc171bb40525a4d9a4204b920f3d43c.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a serious condition! In case of significant damage, report to your local HollowBody unit for regeneration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed Is Sanctuary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/18343652b560c867790edced69c04359.poster.avif?t=1771981312\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/18343652b560c867790edced69c04359.webm?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/extras/18343652b560c867790edced69c04359.mp4?t=1771981312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in Project Cradle, speed is the name of the game. Move at high velocity to generate a protective shield that deflects enemy attacks! Perform high flying feats by jumping while running up slopes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Certain We'll Find Someone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will find people. We just have to! They've gotta be around here somewhere... Maybe they're just hiding? No, I don't know why they'd do something silly like that. Are they just... Really small, maybe? Hmm... Whatever the case, we have to find them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have to.</p>","developers":["ShazySoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757950/header.jpg?t=1771981312","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 and up<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Integrated Graphics or faster<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2757950/2057929552/eac7deb86a21a66ee11f0fc7ceb35b5501491db7/1766984576/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766988109","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2757950/2057929552/eac7deb86a21a66